Filey changes to VectorCraft's web app (Office work > Vector): the control bridge
(apps/vectorcraft-web: vectorcraftControl/vectorcraftOpen) that lets the Filey agent drive it with
VectorCraft's own control protocol, File > Print handed to Filey (fileyPrintPdf), and the app named
"Vector" where users see it.
Upstream: https://github.com/storytold/vectorcraft commit 299a4b36ad808cf84b52ad517fcc623b6263c5ba (main). MIT OR Apache-2.0.

Build: git apply filey-control.patch; cd apps/vectorcraft-web; trunk build --release (CARGO_BUILD_JOBS=2 on 8 GB machines)
Install: node scripts/fetch-office-apps.mjs --app vectorcraft --from <vectorcraft>/dist/web (copy LICENSE-MIT/APACHE in first)

